---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { EMAIL } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  title="About — Tin Le"
  description="About Tin Le, a full-stack software engineer working with C#, ASP.NET Core, and Angular."
>
  <h1 class="page-title text-3xl">About</h1>
  <article class="prose prose-zinc mt-6 max-w-none dark:prose-invert">
    <p>
      I'm Tin, a full-stack software engineer based in Ho Chi Minh City / Remote. I spend most of my time in
      the .NET world &mdash; building web applications with ASP.NET Core and Angular, modernizing
      legacy code bases, and wiring up CI/CD pipelines in Azure.
    </p>

    <p>
      I graduated summa cum laude from Southeast Missouri State University with a B.S. in Computer
      Science and a minor in Mathematics, finishing with a 3.94 GPA (4.0 in-major) as a Regent's
      Scholarship recipient. Since then I've worked as a Full Stack Developer delivering production
      full-stack features end to end across fintech (Netwealth), aviation (American Airlines), and
      public-sector (MWRA) environments.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of work I tinker on side projects like Smeexer, an e-commerce prototype for
      mechanical keyboard products, and small Python tools. I enjoy the whole stack: designing an
      API, shaping the frontend that consumes it, and making sure both ship reliably through good
      pipelines.
    </p>

    <h2>Currently</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Full Stack Software Developer at Orient Software (client: Netwealth Australia)</li>
      <li>Working daily with .NET 10, Angular 22, TypeScript, Azure, and PostgreSQL</li>
      <li>
        Open to interesting problems &mdash; reach me at
        <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>
